{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-truth-panel-logic-1-a-01","date":"2026-11-25","lens":"2","surface":"panel","area":"panel/logic-1","refs":["F-panel-600"],"severity":"S3","title":"Undoing an import leaves the details it filled in for members already in the gym","what":"When the owner imports a file with 'fill in blanks' on, empty details (email, birthday, address and so on) of members already in the gym are filled from the file. Those changes are not marked as part of the import, so 'Undo this import' cannot take them back, and the undo box says it 'removes what this file added' without saying these stay. An import that only filled in details does not even appear in Past imports, so it has no undo at all.","expected":"Undo takes back the details the file filled in, or the undo box plainly says they stay.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/importSave.ts:135","apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/importSave.ts:159-163","apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/undoImport.ts:32-35","apps/dashboard/src/crm/ui/screens/ImportMembers.tsx:1583-1585"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"import-fills-not-tagged-for-undo","who":"owners","how_often":"every import with fill in blanks that is later undone","fix_line":"Remember the old values of filled-in details with the import, and put them back on undo; or say so in the undo box","fix_size":"medium","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-truth-panel-logic-1-a-02","date":"2026-11-25","lens":"17","surface":"panel","area":"panel/logic-1","refs":["F-panel-635","F-panel-614"],"severity":"S3","title":"'Active members' for today can be two different numbers on Today and on Your growth","what":"The Today tile counts members who are not archived and have any running plan, short passes included. Your growth counts this month's active members as of today too, but keeps archived members and leaves out plans under 7 days. A gym that archives a member mid-plan, or sells day or 3-day passes, sees two different 'Active members' numbers for the same day.","expected":"The same words show the same number for the same day, or the growth page says how its count differs.","evidence":["apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/homeTiles.ts:63-65","apps/dashboard/src/crm/store.tsx:382-383","apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/businessGrowth.ts:8","apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/businessGrowth.ts:16-19","apps/dashboard/src/crm/logic/businessGrowth.ts:196-210"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"active-members-two-rules","who":"owners","how_often":"whenever an archived member has a running plan or the gym sells short passes","fix_line":"Use one rule for active members on both screens, or label the growth one differently","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
